    "description": "## Type\n\nClient support request (how-to question).\n\n## Request\n\n* **Requested by:** Emily (WagerTech), 2026-09-22 4:36 PM ET, in the shared Slack channel.\n* **Ask:** Where to go to add an Operator logo in Salesforce.\n* **Slack (client):** https://jumpr-solutions.slack.com/archives/C0BBC05C2HG/p1790109368104729\n\n## Internal notes\n\n* The Logo field pulls from an image URL, not a file upload. The image link must be publicly accessible. The Logo field shows the image automatically after save.\n* Kobi wrote a step-by-step guide: [Operator-Logo-Upload-Guide](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1oHclZGCT2FU1x8kZl6QqXPK9m--j6KJxumZKaKcQhX8/edit?tab=t.0)\n* **Slack (internal):** https://jumpr-solutions.slack.com/archives/C0BRW5L8SUA/p1790109710324399\n\n## Next steps\n\n- [x] Taryn: follow the guide end to end to confirm it works and to learn how to troubleshoot.\n- [x] Put the instructions into the Jumpr Branded template.\n- [x] Share the branded guide with Emily and confirm she can add a logo.\n\n",
